  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "How To: Add Code Context",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "# How To: Add Code Context\n\nHighlighting  relevant code helps AI stay focused. It keeps your prompt precise and ensures feedback connects directly to the lines you’re working on.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/99faadcc634d32c086fb0b3db4bd0b6a-ai-curriculum-societal-impacts.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-highlight-context-test-2025-b166b815-5bfc-4bdb-aa48-5d5b539f41fc"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 1:\n\nTo prompt AI about **specific lines of code**, highlight the lines of code you want AI to focus on.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/97056f9aa9f6b49e213f43eb2a146a7c-Pasted Graphic 18.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-highlight-context-test-2025-4ffa31aa-f645-4171-86ea-b52f771d5f49"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 2:\n\nClick **Add to AI Tutor Chat** to add the lines to your prompt automatically.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8cc6ccc5166c59055150baf5f418678c-Adobe Express - p2.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-highlight-context-test-2025-b0e5cc59-8d90-48e9-8697-a3da6eb78805"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 3: \n\nTo add an **entire code file**, hover over the file and click the three dots. Then, click  **Add to AI Tutor Chat**.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/75d12c5ca29159f88d9e2d84bf5f4a2f-Adobe Express - file.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-highlight-context-test-2025-9d3eac78-2a97-4063-8d41-658b47dfc832",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 4: \n\nIn the prompt text box, explain your goal or issue, and refer to the highlighted section or code file.\n\n<br/>\n\n**Example:** *“Explain the line of code to me.”*",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a2db1f80b134443de94b6cf5d41538f8-Pasted Graphic 19.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-highlight-context-test-2025-2cfc48ec-e2a0-414c-872d-8c7ed3685e0b"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 5:\n\nSubmit your prompt and check if AI’s reasoning connects directly to the selected code.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6ce44abcf16f84737e9926b89ee12a66-Pasted Graphic 20.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-highlight-context-test-2025-22cbcecf-d834-4a8f-9a04-624a1c52b80e"
      }
    ]
  },
